/**
 * @mainpage Keyple Plugin C++ API
 *
 * @section overview Overview
 *
 * The **Keyple Plugin C++ API** is dedicated to the development of specific
 * Keyple plugins, providing the necessary interfaces and contracts for
 * creating custom reader plugins.
 *
 * @section key_features Key Features
 *
 * - Plugin development interfaces
 * - Reader plugin extension points
 * - Standard plugin contracts and lifecycle
 * - Integration with Keyple service layer
 * - Custom reader implementation support
 *
 * @section resources Resources
 *
 * - **Documentation**: [keyple.org](https://keyple.org)
